From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:17:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PCI: apple: bring to #1314's final revision

Bring to its revision in aurora-silicon/linux#1314:
commit df71978666b8 ("PCI: apple: restore the J713 native radio port
after system sleep").
This tree carried an earlier revision:
commit b7686c49daf9 ("PCI: apple: restore the J713 native radio port
after system sleep").
Only the difference between the two.

Based on df71978666b8 from aurora-silicon/linux#1314
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 tools/asahi/radio-sleep-power-tests.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/asahi/radio-sleep-power-tests.c b/tools/asahi/radio-sleep-power-tests.c
index 23124403ed..47231d34d9 100644
--- a/tools/asahi/radio-sleep-power-tests.c
+++ b/tools/asahi/radio-sleep-power-tests.c
@@ -298,7 +298,7 @@ static u64 arch_timer_read_counter(void)
 		return tick--;
 	return stopped_counter ? tick : (tick += 1000);
 }
-static u32 arch_timer_get_rate(void)
+static u32 arch_timer_get_cntfrq(void)
 {
 	return 1000000;
 }
-- 
